diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
index 36e70a8d99c9bb496e297dcddfc53b93d39b3487..56ff0b2d79eb9e3a22f258a0a96bd0704993c62c 100644
--- a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -4,10 +4,15 @@
 
 ### Added
 
+- Added `providers.cursorLiveSteering` (off by default): messages typed while a Cursor turn runs, and background-job results, join that turn after the next tool call instead of waiting for it to end
+- Added Cursor's `videoReview` subagent: a Cursor model hands videos to Gemini 3.1 Pro, which watches them with their sound and reports what it sees and hears. The model copies the video into the session's artifacts folder and attaches it with `Task`'s `file_attachments` (up to 5 videos, 35 MB in total)
+- `ask` results carry the submitted form data in `details.data` beside the readable `answers`, so a host reads the chosen values without parsing the result text
 - Extensions can ask the operator before an interactive quit, or cancel it, with `session_before_shutdown`; a further `/exit` or Ctrl+D skips the pending prompts and closes ([#18424](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/18424) by [@aw1cks](https://github.com/aw1cks))
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- Fixed Cursor models failing to ask questions: their native `AskQuestion` now opens as an `ask` form instead of being rejected with "Interactive questions are not implemented by this client", one question at a time (including `ask` called over MCP), each closing when the turn is aborted. A form the timeout submits reaches Cursor as unanswered. Sessions without `ask` (subagents, headless) still reject it ([#16497](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16497) by [@morali](https://github.com/morali))
+- Fixed Cursor models failing to delegate: their native `Task` now runs an omp subagent (`explore` runs `scout`) and waits for its report instead of being rejected with "Subagents are not implemented by this client"
 - Extension prompts shown from `session_before_*` handlers no longer time out after 30 seconds while the operator is still answering ([#18424](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/18424) by [@aw1cks](https://github.com/aw1cks))
 - A second exit request now skips pending `worktree.onExit` prompts and keeps those worktrees instead of waiting for an answer ([#18424](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/18424) by [@aw1cks](https://github.com/aw1cks))
 ### Fixed
